WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:22.546
Puffs of smoke came from Poppy.

2
00:00:22.547 --> 00:00:25.811
The smoke was gray.

3
00:00:25.812 --> 00:00:28.956
"Yuck!" said Jeb.

4
00:00:28.957 --> 00:00:32.467
"That smoke smells terrible!"

5
00:00:32.468 --> 00:00:36.032
"Poppy!" said Ms. Fender.

6
00:00:36.033 --> 00:00:38.554
"Come to the garage now.

7
00:00:38.555 --> 00:00:41.220
You need a repair."

8
00:00:41.221 --> 00:00:44.244
"No thanks," said Poppy.

9
00:00:44.245 --> 00:00:49.298
"I'm fine!"

10
00:00:49.299 --> 00:00:52.260
Poppy tried to chase her friends.

11
00:00:52.261 --> 00:00:56.419
But now Poppy had more smoke.

12
00:00:56.420 --> 00:00:59.041
The smoke was thick.

13
00:00:59.042 --> 00:01:04.771
It turned black.

14
00:01:04.772 --> 00:01:07.756
Eddy coughed.

15
00:01:07.757 --> 00:01:11.638
Jeb coughed.

16
00:01:11.639 --> 00:01:15.198
Dipper coughed.

17
00:01:15.199 --> 00:01:18.918
"Poppy!" called Ms. Fender.

18
00:01:18.919 --> 00:01:22.019
"Come over here!"

19
00:01:22.020 --> 00:01:25.801
Poppy didn't listen.

20
00:01:25.802 --> 00:01:33.099
She kept playing.

21
00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:36.269
Poppy tried to drive fast.

22
00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:39.750
But she made even more smoke.

23
00:01:39.751 --> 00:01:42.594
Putt, putt, putt.

24
00:01:42.595 --> 00:01:46.180
Poppy went slower and slower.

25
00:01:46.181 --> 00:01:50.670
Finally she rolled to a stop.

26
00:01:50.671 --> 00:01:54.139
"Uh-oh," cried Poppy.

27
00:01:54.140 --> 00:01:58.488
"I'm out of gas!"
